{
  "name": "BC Parks Adventure Ready v3",
  "description": "Complex Handlebars template for BC Parks pass activation and camping recommendations",
  "channelCode": "EMAIL",
  "subject": "Your BC Parks Pass is Ready - {{parksCount}} Parks Await, {{userName}}!",
  "body": "Howdy {{userName}}!

Welcome to the British Columbia Parks Adventure Network! Your annual pass has been activated and you're ready to explore some of the most beautiful parks in Canada.

-----------------------------------------
YOUR BC PARKS PASS
-----------------------------------------

Pass Type: {{passType}}
Validity: {{passYear}}
Status: ACTIVE

{{#if passType}}
{{#if passType 'equals' 'Gold'}}
Gold Member Benefits:
   - Unlimited day-use entry to all BC Parks
   - Reserved parking at premium locations
   - 15% discount on camping fees
   - Exclusive access to backcountry areas
{{else if passType 'equals' 'Silver'}}
Silver Member Benefits:
   - Day-use entry to all BC Parks
   - 10% discount on camping fees
   - Access to select backcountry areas
{{else}}
Standard Pass Benefits:
   - Day-use entry to most BC Parks
   - Standard camping rates apply
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

-----------------------------------------
FEATURED BC PARKS ({{featuredCount}})
-----------------------------------------

{{#each featuredParks}}
{{#if this.parkName}}
{{#if this.region}}
{{this.parkName}} ({{this.region}})
{{else}}
{{this.parkName}}
{{/if}}

   {{this.description}}

   {{#if this.difficulty}}
   Difficulty Level: {{this.difficulty}}/5
   {{/if}}

   {{#if this.activities}}
   Activities Available:
   {{#each this.activities}}
     - {{this}}
   {{/each}}
   {{/if}}

   {{#if this.campgroundsAvailable}}
   Campsites Available: {{this.availableSites}}/{{this.totalSites}}
   {{#if this.isFull}}
   [Almost full!]
   {{else if this.isGettingFull}}
   [Getting full, book soon!]
   {{else}}
   [Plenty of spots available!]
   {{/if}}
   {{/if}}

   {{#if this.beachAccess}}
   Beach Access Available
   {{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{/each}}

-----------------------------------------
SEASONAL RECOMMENDATIONS
-----------------------------------------

{{#if season}}
{{#if season 'equals' 'summer'}}
SUMMER ADVENTURES:
Perfect time for high-elevation hikes! Check out:
{{#each summerRecommendations}}
   - {{this.parkName}}: {{this.reason}}
{{/each}}

{{else if season 'equals' 'fall'}}
FALL FOLIAGE SEASON:
Witness the stunning autumn colors at these parks:
{{#each fallRecommendations}}
   - {{this.parkName}} (Peak foliage: {{this.peakDate}})
{{/each}}

{{else if season 'equals' 'winter'}}
WINTER WONDERLAND:
Snowshoeing and backcountry skiing destinations:
{{#each winterRecommendations}}
   - {{this.parkName}} (Elevation: {{this.elevation}}m)
{{/each}}

{{else}}
SPRING BLOOMS:
Wildflowers and wildlife viewing at their best:
{{#each springRecommendations}}
   - {{this.parkName}} (Best viewing time: {{this.bloomDate}})
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

-----------------------------------------
POPULAR ROUTES FROM {{userCity}}
-----------------------------------------

{{#each nearestParks}}
{{#if this.parkName}}
{{this.parkName}}
   Distance: {{this.distance}} km
   Drive Time: {{this.driveTime}} minutes
   Road Conditions: {{this.roadConditions}}
   {{#if this.winterClosure}}
   [Winter Road Closure: {{this.closureMonths}}]
   {{/if}}
   {{#if this.wheelchairAccessible}}
   Accessibility: Yes
   {{else}}
   Accessibility: No
   {{/if}}
   {{#if this.petFriendly}}
   Pet-Friendly Trails Available
   {{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{/each}}

-----------------------------------------
WILDLIFE SPOTTING GUIDE
-----------------------------------------

{{#each wildlife}}
{{#if this.species}}
{{#if this.endangered}}
{{this.species}} (ENDANGERED - Observe from distance)
{{else}}
{{this.species}}
{{/if}}
   Habitat: {{this.habitat}}
   Best Viewing Season: {{this.season}}
   {{#if this.highDanger}}
   [CAUTION: Keep 100m+ distance, carry bear spray]
   {{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{/each}}

-----------------------------------------
YOUR TRIP CHECKLIST
-----------------------------------------

Before heading out, make sure you have:
{{#each tripChecklist}}
{{#if this.essential}}
X {{this.item}} [ESSENTIAL]
{{else}}
- {{this.item}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

-----------------------------------------
CHALLENGE: VISIT 10 PARKS BY {{challengeDeadline}}
-----------------------------------------

{{#if userChallengeProgress}}
Your Progress: {{userChallengeProgress}}/10 Parks Visited

{{#if challengeCompleted}}
CONGRATULATIONS! You've completed the challenge!
You've earned:
   - {{challengeReward}}
   - Certificate of Exploration
   - Exclusive BC Parks merchandise
{{else if challengeHalfway}}
You're over halfway there! Keep pushing to reach 10 parks!
{{else}}
Great start! Keep exploring!
{{/if}}
{{else}}
Get started! Visit your first park this weekend!
{{/if}}

-----------------------------------------
IMPORTANT REMINDERS
-----------------------------------------

{{#if weatherAlerts}}
WEATHER ALERT:
{{#each weatherAlerts}}
   {{this.alertType}} in {{this.affectedArea}}
   {{this.alertMessage}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if closedParks}}
TEMPORARILY CLOSED PARKS:
{{#each closedParks}}
   - {{this.parkName}} (Reason: {{this.reason}})
   - Expected reopening: {{this.reopenDate}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if hasReservations}}
You have {{reservationCount}} active camping reservations.
Manage your bookings at: www.discovercamping.ca
{{/if}}

-----------------------------------------

{{#if isLocalResident}}
As a BC resident, you have access to exclusive provincial discounts at participating parks!
{{/if}}

{{#if isFirstTimeUser}}
Welcome to the BC Parks community! Join our online forum at parks.bc.ca/community to share photos and tips with other adventurers!
{{/if}}

Explore. Discover. Protect. That's the BC Parks way!

Happy Trails,
The BC Parks Team

P.S. - Remember to practice Leave No Trace principles to keep our parks pristine for future generations!",
  "engineCode": "handlebars"
}

